      "impact": "The new ping_worker helper adds input validation, timeout handling, and return-code mapping, but the PR adds no unit tests for any of those branches. Regressions such as accepting option-like hosts, allowing invalid counts, treating timeouts as success, or misreporting ping failures would not be caught before merge.",
